;; owner: L10a. fib.seq.chars: str as a Reducible of its characters. Exports: Chars; Reducible char for Chars and for str.
;; Until L10a writes it this part is its ns form alone (tranche 1 plan §4.2); the :use lines are the
;; facades above it and the parts of its own facade that P0 wrote. The owner replaces these three lines with the part's own header.
(ns fib.seq.chars (:use fib.core fib.seq.types fib.seq.protocols fib.seq.lseq fib.seq.vseq))
